plot3d(relVol * 100, "Rel Volume", "ridgeline", "#22ccff", "separate", 1)`},{name:"MACD 3D Ribbon",description:"MACD line and signal line as glowing 3D ribbons",category:"3D Visualizations",source:`// MACD 3D Ribbon
